DUCC FFT reference source
-------------------------

The reference harness under benches/reference includes DUCC headers and links
DUCC support translation units from the external checkout at commit
c1ed01b8fda69d2a378190f0915f1a19762dddbf. The checkout is not copied into this
crate and the harness does not distribute DUCC binaries.

